        "The willingness to sacrifice all worldly wealth and property for the sake of the Deen.",
        "The importance of sincere dua and seeking the highest level of martyrdom.",
        "The realization that the sanctity of truth outweighs the sanctity of tradition.",
        "Patience and steadfastness when faced with public criticism or misunderstanding.",
