        "The army marched to the wells of Badr. On the 17th of Ramadan, when the two forces clashed, 'Umayr (RA) fought with a bravery that belied his years. He plunged into the heart of the battle, defending the faith alongside his brother. During the heat of the combat, he was struck down by Amr ibn Abd Wudd (who was later killed at the Trench), becoming one of the fourteen martyrs of Badr.",
